{
  "borough": "Waltham Forest",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;color:#0D0D0D;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-GB&quot;&gt;The existing shop frontage by way of its design, appearance\r\nand blank, low visual quality façade would not be supported under planning\r\npermission due to its impact to the character and appearance to the unit and\r\nthe primary shopping area of Highams’ Park. The proposal is contrary to policy 45\r\nand 53 of Waltham Forests LP1 (2024).&amp;nbsp;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-GB&quot;&gt;The submitted information consists of insufficient and ambiguous information\r\nwith regards to the existing and proposed use of the commercial unit and\r\ntherefore officers are unable to assess the acceptability of the principle of the development or the amenity\r\nimpact in terms of noise, odour and disturbance of the proposal to ensure an acceptable development is proposed for\r\nthe Highams Park Primary Shopping Area and for the neighbouring occupiers of Winchester\r\nRoad. As such, the development is contrary to policies 11, 41, and 57 of Waltham Forests\r\nLP1 (2024).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB&quot;&gt;The\r\napplication contains insufficient information with regards to use to determine\r\nwhether a flood risk assessment would be required, and has failed to submit a sustainable\r\nurban drainage strategy, or information to ensure drainage and water-run off\r\nwould be sufficient in relation to the lower ground level basement excavation. The\r\ndevelopment is contrary to 87 and 91 of Waltham Forests LP1 (2024).&amp;nbsp;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
